omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9uJWMjDdsW4Q7kNvwH132VX&_nc_oc=AdqLWlB9fyDkhwoRa8dFLGo7oWt24P5LmPVTr4FXRPKZAPJq_fDVXuXmD8YAU6LQkTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKB0G3bhglIviNbpTfUC8w_uJBd8xmupaSibOnuJ9l5-w&oe=6AAD5734"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ThScSUiWARcQ7kNvwE5TIjP&_nc_oc=Adqv5vDEwJR7yWxFQR9c9AjOf4UyzNke0NQ5AQsG69ylWFyo3bfp7JJHCYo2k1SIeC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJWrC7MtALMu6nVIOWMP-Dtbg_tqni47q5S8vPIVHU05A&oe=6AAD5896"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLJXKBT6EJMQ7kNvwF1K7JE&_nc_oc=AdqedvI942-r5kBlir4ZHVYcB_KO_0YEyZ_etS0ZzwjWngyB49ZTUlo8867L4wRxOEs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLSdYwpvmaJQAp7DYXm8Hcvp_4c2xwTPsQFa-85ueXVIw&oe=6AAD3577"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://